---
description: |
  Builds an OCSF User from a Kunai identity.

  A Kunai identity pairs a numeric user ID and group ID with the names that
  Kunai resolved from the passwd and group databases. The operator marks the
  user with ID 0 as an administrator.
args:
  positional:
    - name: identity
      type: field
      description: The Kunai identity to consume.
    - name: user
      type: field
      description: The field that receives the OCSF user.
---

$user = {
  uid: $identity.uid.string(),
  name: move $identity.user,
  type_id: 2 if $identity.uid == 0 else null,
  groups: [{uid: (move $identity.gid).string(), name: move $identity.group}],
}
drop $identity.uid
